      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIRTY DOES IT (5) scored a tidy win over 1100m at Port Macquarie two runs back. Stepped up to this trip last time but had no hope after the saddle shifted. Big chance on that form from two starts ago. HARD JAKKA (6) came from the clouds to score over a similar distance to this at Port Macquarie before putting in a poor one behind DIRTY DOES IT last time over 1100m. Better placed back up to this trip so watch for a spike in form. MONACO FLYER (8) has been consistent this prep in all track conditions. Led and gave a sight but found one better most recently over 1175m here. Track specialist who is sure to play a key role again. ALL TOO SNEAKY (4) took 27 starts to win his maiden but has now scored at two of his last four, most recently by a narrow margin over today's trip at Port Macquarie. Gets in okay after the claim so another big run is on the cards. COCO DREAMING (2) has performed well at all three runs this prep and should be peaking now.",
